#: ninefruits/i18n/vendor_strings.py
msgid "Forgotten your password? Enter your email address below, and we'll send you an email allowing you to reset it."
msgstr "Parolni unutdingizmi? Quyida email manzilingizni kiriting, biz sizga uni qayta o'rnatishga ruxsat beruvchi emailni yuboramiz."

